                                    <FontFamily>Segoe UI</FontFamily>
                                    <FontSize>8pt</FontSize>
                                    <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                                  </Style>
                                </TextRun>
                                <TextRun>
                                  <Value>: The service provider shall not be held liable for delays or non-performance due to causes beyond reasonable control including, but not limited to, natural calamities, strikes, or government regulations.</Value>
                                  <Style>
